  "notes": "Modified cash basis city (governmental funds modified cash, enterprise funds accrual); basis set to cash as in FY2023-FY2025. Governmental roll-forward uses the fund balances on p5 (1,473,033 -> 1,167,258); beginning cash not printed (null); ending cash 998,992 and certificates of deposit 158,235 from the governmental funds balance sheet Total column p4 (county treasurer cash 10,031 printed separately, not added). Governmental lines from Total Governmental Funds column p5; the Total column prints only the net transfer (92,678 out); business-type +92,678 (Water Fund). Business-type from the proprietary statement p7 Total column (accrual, net position, as later years); no single total printed, so totals are operating + nonoperating; beginning net position restated (6,440,720 as originally reported + restatement 33,000 = 6,473,720, p7). Other revenue counted in Charges for Services on the Statement of Activities. Proprietary cash flow statement p8 (Electric Fund page only in the trim) not recorded (proprietary null as in later years). Balance sheet: government-wide Statement of Net Position p1 (includes governmental capital assets), component unit excluded. General Fund detail from the departmental combining schedule p13 (more detailed than the p9 budget schedule, which is not recorded). Proprietary statement lines not added to detail (as later years). Read pages 1-13 of 13"
